    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Imagine Balatro and Inscryption had a baby. That taught itself to play pool. With bullets. In hell.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pool of Madness is a Lovecraftian roguelite pool  by the creators of Dagon: by H. P. Lovecraft (1.8 million+ downloads).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHOOT. LOOT. BLEED. REPEAT.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/f39125edd5eb6b51831e0f0086d386b8.poster.avif?t=1754640737\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/f39125edd5eb6b51831e0f0086d386b8.webm?t=1754640737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/f39125edd5eb6b51831e0f0086d386b8.mp4?t=1754640737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cue. Gun. Cosmic dread. Everything explodes. You <span class=\"bb_strike\">walk out</span> die in slow motion, a bloody grin on your blackened face.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a <strong>roguelite</strong> <strong>fusion </strong>of trick shots (<strong>pool</strong>), ricochets (<strong>pinball</strong>), and raw firepower (<strong>shooter</strong>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>seamless cue-gun interplay</strong> for addictive flow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > pool tables are altars<strong>,</strong>\u00a0cue and gun: instruments of the liturgy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Perform rituals to lure out void horrors.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE YOUR CUE WITH NEW LOOT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/b8b2117f41f931c3fff9e88b32c0b80f.poster.avif?t=1754640737\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/b8b2117f41f931c3fff9e88b32c0b80f.webm?t=1754640737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/b8b2117f41f931c3fff9e88b32c0b80f.mp4?t=1754640737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ever-evolving cue should make the next ritual easier. It will certainly make it different.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >quickly <strong>upgrade your cue with collected parts and try out the upgraded build</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>unlock new powerups</strong>, complete the ritual and get ready for the next terror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and if all else fails, <strong>use your gun</strong> to blast your way out\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lose your mind, reforge your conduit, return stronger.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BREAK IT TILL YOU MAKE IT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/2757e431d4dc1e1233d993cd22ae88ff.poster.avif?t=1754640737\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/2757e431d4dc1e1233d993cd22ae88ff.webm?t=1754640737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/2757e431d4dc1e1233d993cd22ae88ff.mp4?t=1754640737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by games like Dark Souls, Inscryption and\u2026 pool, PoM emphasises mystery, discovery and replayability.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>break rules</strong> and improvise<strong> to survive</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>discover blood-pumping synergies,\u00a0multipliers,\u00a0chain\u00a0reactions</strong> and master the  chaos*</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*picture fish exploding midair in slo-mo, powerups raining down, balls bouncing off their tails and ramping into premium-scored pockets</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ritual is law. Everything else is yours to break.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><strong>FACE VOID HORRORS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/082ff25d785dac47ddfba6c5b6dfea17.poster.avif?t=1754640737\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/082ff25d785dac47ddfba6c5b6dfea17.webm?t=1754640737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/082ff25d785dac47ddfba6c5b6dfea17.mp4?t=1754640737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rituals are your baptism of blood, preparing you to face a void lurker: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>complete rituals to <strong>lure out ancient horrors</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>hunt them down</strong>, get more loot,\u00a0uncover the story of the missing ship crew</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or <strong>die </strong>trying - <strong>solo or with friends</strong> -<strong> and come back stronger</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Slay void beasts for loot.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHALK - SPIN - HUNT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/645f7d40d872b45b0f4c7c14390edf96.poster.avif?t=1754640737\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/645f7d40d872b45b0f4c7c14390edf96.webm?t=1754640737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/645f7d40d872b45b0f4c7c14390edf96.mp4?t=1754640737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So rise up, chalk the cue and spin the chamber, voidhunter, for the ritual begins anew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><i>In other words:\u00a0<strong>Shoot some balls. Go insane. Try again.\u00a0</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOMETHING WICKED THIS WAY COMES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let it be known: this beast is still growing. The game is currently at an early stage of development. The playtests and media do not reflect the quality of the final release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15% of revenue donated to charity organisations (chosen with our community on Discord).</p>",
